cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CLIMB in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CLIMB: Cerebellar Learning and Interchangeable Models' Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  CLIMB tests granule-layer models inside a fixed reference cerebellar
  circuit on eyeblink conditioning (delay and trace), built in Nengo.
  Users fill in their own granule layer as a GranuleLayer subclass, and a
  live browser panel lets two models learn side by side on identical input.
